#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ahoy, captain! Let's learn the bird dog."
msgstr "Ehilà, {crew|capitano|capitana|capitani|capitane}! Impariamo il bird dog."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Get on all fours: hands under the shoulders, knees under the hips."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Mettiti|Mettiti|Mettetevi} a quattro zampe: mani sotto le spalle, ginocchia sotto i fianchi."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Keep your back flat, like a table."
msgstr "{crew|Tieni|Tieni|Tenete} la schiena dritta, come un tavolo."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Look at the floor, a little ahead of your hands."
msgstr "{crew|Guarda|Guarda|Guardate} il pavimento, un po' davanti alle mani."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Stretch one arm forward and the opposite leg back."
msgstr "{crew|Allunga|Allunga|Allungate} un braccio in avanti e la gamba opposta indietro."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hold still: belly tight, hips level."
msgstr "{crew|Resta immobile|Resta immobile|Restate immobili}: pancia in dentro, fianchi dritti."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Then slowly back..."
msgstr "Poi piano piano indietro..."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "...and the other arm with the other leg."
msgstr "...e l'altro braccio con l'altra gamba."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Don't let your back sag..."
msgstr "Non {crew|far|far|fate} cadere la schiena..."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "...keep it flat."
msgstr "...{crew|tienila|tienila|tenetela} dritta."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Don't throw your head up..."
msgstr "Non {crew|alzare|alzare|alzate} di colpo la testa..."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "...look at the floor."
msgstr "...{crew|guarda|guarda|guardate} il pavimento."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Don't let your hip roll open..."
msgstr "Non {crew|girare|girare|girate} il fianco..."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "...keep your hips level."
msgstr "...{crew|tieni|tieni|tenete} i fianchi alla stessa altezza."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Don't kick your leg up too high..."
msgstr "Non {crew|alzare|alzare|alzate} troppo la gamba..."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "...level with your back is enough."
msgstr "...all'altezza della schiena basta."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Not fast and jerky..."
msgstr "Non veloce e a scatti..."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "...but slow and calm."
msgstr "...ma lento e calmo."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "2/2  How you steer the boat"
msgstr "2/2  Come {crew|guidi|guidi|guidate} la barca"

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Look: this is you, as the camera sees you."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Guarda: questo sei tu|Guarda: questa sei tu|Guardate: questi siete voi|Guardate: queste "
"siete voi}, come {crew|ti|ti|vi} vede la telecamera."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The arm on the left lifts the wheel on the left: the boat turns right."
msgstr "Il braccio a sinistra alza il timone a sinistra: la barca gira a destra."

#: scenes/instruction/instruction.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The arm on the right lifts the wheel on the right: the boat turns left."
