#: data/missions/06_doctor_of_ragusa/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Doctor of Ragusa"
msgstr "Il dottore di Ragusa"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/06_doctor_of_ragusa/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A fever spreads around the Bay of Kotor. Find Doctor Marin and bring his medicine."
msgstr ""
"Una febbre si diffonde intorno alle Bocche di Kotor. Trovate il dottor Marin e portate la sua "
"medicina."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/06_doctor_of_ragusa/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In 1377, Ragusa was the first city to keep travellers apart for a while before they could enter: a"
" quarantine, against the illnesses. The pharmacy of the Franciscans in Dubrovnik, from 1317, still"
" sells medicine today."
msgstr ""
"Nel 1377 Ragusa fu la prima città a tenere i viaggiatori in disparte per un po' prima di farli "
"entrare: la quarantena, contro le malattie. La farmacia dei francescani di Dubrovnik, del 1317, "
"vende medicine ancora oggi."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/06_doctor_of_ragusa/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The fever is gone!"
msgstr "La febbre è sparita!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/06_doctor_of_ragusa/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Doctor Marin's medicine reached Kotor just in time."
msgstr "La medicina del dottor Marin è arrivata a Kotor appena in tempo."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/06_doctor_of_ragusa/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The children of the bay are well again."
msgstr "I bambini della baia stanno di nuovo bene."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/07_theatre_of_hvar/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, Hvar opens a theatre for everybody, rich and poor!"
msgstr "{crew|Capitano|Capitana|Capitani|Capitane}, Hvar apre un teatro per tutti, ricchi e poveri!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/07_theatre_of_hvar/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "But the Aga's men scared my actors away, all along the coast."
msgstr "Ma gli uomini dell'Aga hanno fatto scappare i miei attori, lungo tutta la costa."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/07_theatre_of_hvar/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Find them and bring them to Hvar before the opening night!"
msgstr "Trovateli e portateli a Hvar prima del debutto!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/07_theatre_of_hvar/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Aga's men said a jester is a useless man."
