"Gli uomini dell'Aga hanno fatto scappare gli attori. Portateli a Hvar per l'apertura del teatro."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/07_theatre_of_hvar/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Hvar's theatre opened in 1612 above the town's galley shed. It is one of the oldest public "
"theatres in Europe, paid for by the town for all the people of Hvar."
msgstr ""
"Il teatro di Hvar aprì nel 1612 sopra l'arsenale delle galee. È uno dei teatri pubblici più "
"antichi d'Europa, pagato dalla città per tutta la gente di Hvar."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/07_theatre_of_hvar/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The theatre is full!"
msgstr "Il teatro è pieno!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/07_theatre_of_hvar/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The jester, the singer and the storyteller made it to Hvar."
msgstr "Il giullare, la cantante e il cantastorie sono arrivati a Hvar."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/07_theatre_of_hvar/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The whole town laughs, sings and listens together."
msgstr "Tutta la città ride, canta e ascolta insieme."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/08_across_the_sea/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Welcome, captain. The villages have written down everything the Aga did."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Benvenuti|Benvenute|Benvenuti|Benvenute}, {crew|capitano|capitana|capitani|capitane}. I "
"villaggi hanno scritto tutto quello che ha fatto l'Aga."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/08_across_the_sea/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring their complaint to the envoy of the Pope in Ancona."
msgstr "Portate il loro reclamo all'inviato del Papa ad Ancona."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/08_across_the_sea/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here is my letter of recommendation. Cross the sea, and may the wind be kind!"
msgstr "Ecco la mia lettera di raccomandazione. Attraversate il mare, e che il vento vi sia amico!"

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/08_across_the_sea/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the complaint across the sea to {port}."
msgstr "Portate il reclamo al di là del mare, {port@to}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/08_across_the_sea/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A complaint about an aga? Let me read it."
msgstr "Un reclamo contro un aga? Fatemelo leggere."

