#: data/missions/08_across_the_sea/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which emperor's arch stands at our harbour?"
msgstr "L'arco di quale imperatore sta nel nostro porto?"

#. an answer on a button, a few words
#: data/missions/08_across_the_sea/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
