#. what a judge says before the questions, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/08_across_the_sea/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "But first, tell me: are you really sailors who know our sea?"
msgstr "Ma prima ditemi: siete davvero marinai che conoscono il nostro mare?"

