#: data/missions/08_across_the_sea/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hmm, no. Look around the harbour, and think again!"
msgstr "Mmm, no. Guardatevi intorno nel porto, e pensateci ancora!"

#. what a judge says after the right answers, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/08_across_the_sea/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
