#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "They took my olives as a tax, and came back a week later for more."
msgstr "Hanno preso le mie olive come tassa, e una settimana dopo sono tornati a prenderne altre."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I will tell the judge everything."
